    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Cohesion of the Primal · уровень 10</b></p><p>Dreamer: Master Foresayer. When you activate your<br>Stored Foresight spell as a Bonus Action, you can roll<br>1d4. On a 4, the stored spell is not expended.<br>Seeker: Advanced Disruption. When a spell with a single target affects you or an ally within 10 feet, you may use your Reaction and expend a spell slot equal to or higher than the spell’s level. If you do, the spell fails.<br>Once you use this feature, you cannot do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Seeker дополнительно тратит слот не ниже отменяемого заклинания.</li></ul>"
